{
  "description": "What the app reads of the server api (checked by AppApiContractTest in projectforge-application). Per contract: the Dart files, the endpoints the app calls, and the fields it reads of the answer (paths below the answer class, [] for lists). Every ['key'] a listed Dart file reads must be named here, and everything named here must exist on the server. Removing or renaming a field that is named here breaks the published app: see dev-docs/flutter-client.md, 'Changing an api the app uses'.",
